A stylized logo featuring a construction crane silhouette against a blue background, with the word "BuildPro" in bold, modern sans-serif font below the crane. The crane should be in a contrasting color (e.g., orange) to stand out, and the background should be a subtle gradient from light blue at the top to darker blue at the bottom. The overall design should convey strength, precision, and modernity, suitable for a construction tools app.
